{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき( *・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも．『素敵な報告ができそう♪』とか言って溜めたくせにわりとすぐに中田ブログでタネあかししていて完全に時代遅れみたいになった若月です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の乃木どこで喋った怖い話の続きを書こうかなって!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもきっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうのが苦手な方もいるはずだから、記事の一番最後に書くねσ(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼淡い感じでパシャリ＊／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/08/10/3579741/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね、気づけば前髪が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凪がすような前髪になってらっしゃる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにいまだに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪を切るか流すか悩んでいます。こうしてまた日が落ちていくんです。.........笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、前髪は有った方がいいっていう意見のが多いんだけどね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何せ前髪がおでこ上にあると肌荒れがやばいんです...ずーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型で悩む!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり自分は女子だった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなつっこみさておいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"序盤で触れましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、乃木坂46!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集を出しますヽ(*´▽)ノ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーい＊♪拍手"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね、夏!!って感じ♪笑←黙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなとこいったなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変なこともあったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な作品になってるはず!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮られているメンバーをみて改めて乃木坂46のメンバーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅力的だなって思いました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん期待してまっててください(´ー｀)ノきゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼なんだか懐かしさを感じる顔／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2013/08/10/3579741/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い話行きましょうか!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊...＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡県に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある心霊スポットの山での話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"８月の猛暑が続く真夏だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのにその日はなぜか珍しく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涼しい夜だったそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男2人で肝試しに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その山に車で登りに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一時間程かけて山を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回りましたが結局何も起きずに見ずに終わった為、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『つまんね。』と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山を降りようとした時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『そこの車止まりなさい。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然警察に後ろから声をかけられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別にスピードを出していた訳でもなく可笑しいと思いながらもはじに寄せ，車から降りて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『多分違反してないっすよ。なんすか？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と答えたそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すると警察が車を指差して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『君たち。四人乗りの車だろう。............車に何人の人を乗せていくんだね。』と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬何のことを言っているのか分からなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車を見る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"警察の話では車の中には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかしいくらいにパンパンに人が乗っていたという。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一体、警察は何を見たのでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『いや、見間違えっすよ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう言って2人は車に乗り直して山をおりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車の後部座席の窓を見るとそこには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の手形があったそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内側から。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばかつきぃ♪"}],"source":"archive"}